<title>BELGIUM: EU confirms UK and Irish green rate increases.</title>
<headline>EU confirms UK and Irish green rate increases.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Thursday confirmed that the UK and Irish green pound rates will be revalued with effect from Saturday.</p>
<p>The new rates are 0.742320 per Ecu for the pound sterling compared with the old rate of 0.768177, and 0.756658 for the Irish pound compared with the old rate of 0.778173.</p>
<p>The change was calculated on Thursday because the Commission is on holiday on Friday.</p>
<p>Green rates are used by the European Union to convert agricultural payments from Ecus into national currencies. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
